---
import aboutImage from "../assets/About.svg";
import aboutSide from "../assets/about-image.jpg";
---

<section>
    <h2 class="section-header text-center text-[40px] flex justify-center">
        <img class="w-[400px]" src={aboutImage.src} alt="Abstract background" />
    </h2>
    <div class="content-section about-me grid md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="flex justify-center">
            <img class="w-full" src={aboutSide.src} alt="Abstract background" />
        </div>
        <p class="text-[18px] md:text-[20px] content-center md:text-left">
            Fusing the nostalgic energy of the 90s with the power of modern web
            technologies, my work resurrects the creative spirit of the early
            internet to deliver cutting-edge, memorable experiences. My passion
            for this style is built on a strong foundation of modern development
            practices, allowing me to create everything from unique, expressive
            websites to clean, professional, and effective solutions for any
            client.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
